  "authored_scope": "Random scenes cover several things. Background and frame colours are sampled. Box/core shapes default to 3/1, 4/2, 5/1, 5/3 and 6/2, and any valid size/core pair up to size 12 can be requested. The lattice is 2..4 x 2..4, capped by the 30x30 fit, with gaps of 1..4 and up to a quarter of slots empty. Paths can skip empty slots, so long bridges are possible, and they turn in all four directions. Up to two unvisited distractor boxes may be added. Labels repeat heavily, while the overall labelling still has exactly one matching path. Not supported: legend rows anywhere other than height-2 starting at column 1; non-square or non-uniform boxes; cores that are not centred; paths with fewer than 4 boxes; scenes with multiple valid paths.",
  "authored_constraints": [
    "bg != frame; labels exclude bg and frame",
